{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld editions": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld edition"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld editions"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "et": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld väljaanne"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld väljaannet"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of 5 stars": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of 5 stars"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld of 5 stars"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "et": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld tärn viiest"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld tärni viiest"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld pages": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld page"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld pages"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "et": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld lk"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld lk"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book's page lists these, in this order. With none chosen, it shows ESTER, Rahva Raamat and Apollo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatu lehel on need selles järjekorras. Kui ühtegi pole valitud, on seal ESTER, Rahva Raamat ja Apollo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A private reading tracker for Estonian and English books. No account, no ads, no tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privaatne lugemispäevik eesti- ja ingliskeelsete raamatute jaoks. Kontota, reklaamita, jälgimiseta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Loe": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a book": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisa raamat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a cover photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisa kaanepilt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a library or bookshop": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisa raamatukogu või raamatupood"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it yourself": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisa ise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to shelf": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisa riiulisse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Loe to use the camera in Settings, or type the ISBN into Search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Luba Loel seadetes kaamerat kasutada või sisesta ISBN otsingusse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another language": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muu keel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Välimus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Author": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Availability comes from ESTER, the catalogue Estonian libraries share, run by the ELNET Consortium.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saadavus tuleb ESTERist, Eesti raamatukogude ühisest kataloogist, mida peab ELNET Konsortsium."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatuid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books from abroad, and covers": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Välismaal ilmunud raamatud ja kaaned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books published abroad and the covers of books come from Open Library, an open catalogue run by the Internet Archive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Välismaal ilmunud raamatud ja raamatute kaaned tulevad Open Libraryst, avatud kataloogist, mida peab Internet Archive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books published abroad. Loe asks Open Library about what you search for, and nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Välismaal ilmunud raamatud. Loe küsib Open Libraryst ainult seda, mida sa otsid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bookshop": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatupood"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bookshops": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatupoed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By the same author": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Samalt autorilt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't find it? Add it yourself": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei leia? Lisa ise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loobu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Catalogue": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kataloog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change the cover photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muuda kaanepilti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for a new edition": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otsi uut väljaannet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the spelling, try the author's name, or add the book yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrolli kirjapilti, proovi autori nime või lisa raamat ise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrolli ühendust ja proovi uuesti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked for a new edition": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uut väljaannet viimati otsitud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking iCloud…": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vaatan iCloudi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontrollin…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vali pilt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't check right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Praegu ei õnnestunud kontrollida"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't check. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ei saanud vaadata. Kontrolli ühendust ja proovi uuesti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cover: Open Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kaanepilt: Open Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Covers": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kaaned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Covers come from Open Library and the Internet Archive, which see which books' covers were asked for. Loe keeps the covers on your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kaaned tulevad Open Libraryst ja Internet Archive'ist, kes näevad, milliste raamatute kaasi küsiti. Loe hoiab kaasi sinu telefonis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credits": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tänuga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crime and mystery": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krimi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Didn't finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jäi pooleli"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valmis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download it again": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laadi uuesti alla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download it in Search, then give the books you've read a rating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laadi see otsingus alla ja hinda siis loetud raamatuid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download the catalogue": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laadi kataloog alla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading it, and looking once a week for a new edition, fetches files from GitHub. Nothing about you is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selle allalaadimiseks ja kord nädalas uue väljaande otsimiseks tuuakse failid GitHubist. Sinu kohta ei saadeta midagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading the catalogue": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kataloog laaditakse alla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Due back %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tähtaeg %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ESTER and ELNET": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ESTER ja ELNET"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each of these sees your phone's internet address, as any website would. Nothing Loe sends carries an account, cookies or your name, and Loe keeps no record of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igaüks neist näeb sinu telefoni internetiaadressi, nagu iga veebisait. Miski, mida Loe saadab, ei kanna kontot, küpsiseid ega sinu nime, ja Loe ei pea sellest arvet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muuda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit book": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muuda raamatut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edition": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Väljaanne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Editions": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Väljaanded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every book published in Estonia, from the National Library of Estonia, so search works offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kõik Eestis ilmunud raamatud, Eesti Rahvusraamatukogult, et otsing töötaks ka võrguta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Family and drama": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elu ja suhted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fantasy": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fantaasia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tagasiside"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a book": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leia raamat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a book in Search and add it to a shelf.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otsi raamatut ja lisa see riiulisse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a library": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otsi raamatukogu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From Open Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Libraryst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From your tastes: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu maitse järgi: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give a book you've read four or five stars, or pick what you like to read in Settings, and Loe will suggest more like it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anna loetud raamatule neli või viis tärni või vali seadetes, mida sulle meeldib lugeda, ja Loe soovitab sarnaseid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Headings are set in Newsreader by Production Type. Copyright 2020 The Newsreader Project Authors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pealkirjad on laotud Production Type'i kirjatüübis Newsreader. Copyright 2020 The Newsreader Project Authors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Historical": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajalooline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horror": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Õudus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Humour": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Huumor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ keeles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In storage, can be ordered": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoidlas, saab tellida"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be from a newer version of Loe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See võib olla Loe uuemast versioonist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last synced %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viimati sünkroonitud %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Libraries": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatukogud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Libraries and bookshops": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatukogud ja raamatupoed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatukogu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hele"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lingid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links on a book's page open in your browser, like any other link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raamatu lehel olevad lingid avanevad sinu brauseris nagu iga teine link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe found nothing close enough to the books you rated highly. Rate a few more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe ei leidnud midagi piisavalt sarnast raamatutele, mida kõrgelt hindasid. Hinda veel mõnda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe has no ads, no analytics and no tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loes pole reklaame, analüütikat ega jälgimist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe keeps every Estonian book on your phone, so search works offline. It's one download of about 30 MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe hoiab kõiki eesti raamatuid sinu telefonis, nii et otsing töötab ka võrguühenduseta. Selleks tuleb üks kord alla laadida umbes 30 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe's catalogue is built from the Estonian National Bibliography, the National Library's record of the books published in Estonia. It is open data under CC0 1.0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe kataloog on tehtud Eesti rahvusbibliograafiast, Rahvusraamatukogu andmebaasist Eestis ilmunud raamatute kohta. See on avaandmed CC0 1.0 alusel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loe's code is open under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The name Loe, its marks and its icon are not part of the licence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loe kood on avatud Mozilla Public License 2.0 alusel. Nimi Loe, selle märgid ja ikoon litsentsi alla ei kuulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More by the author of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veel %@ autorilt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "National Library of Estonia": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eesti Rahvusraamatukogu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New changes stay on this phone until there's room. Free up space or get more in the Settings app, under your name and iCloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uued muudatused jäävad selles telefonis ootele, kuni ruumi tuleb. Vabasta ruumi või hangi seda juurde rakenduses Seaded, oma nime ja iCloudi alt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Newsreader": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
