    "When you stop typing, Loe asks Open Library about what you typed. Open Library, run by the Internet Archive, sees what you searched for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kui lõpetad trükkimise, küsib Loe Open Library käest, mida sa kirjutasid. Open Library, mida peab Internet Archive, näeb, mida otsisid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you've chosen libraries, opening a book asks ESTER whether they have it. ESTER sees which book was asked about.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kui oled raamatukogud valinud, küsib raamatu avamine ESTERilt, kas neil see on. ESTER näeb, millise raamatu kohta küsiti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where to get it": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kust saada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether a library has a book": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kas raamatukogus on raamat olemas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether a library has the book comes from ESTER, the libraries' catalogue, which Loe asks about this book and nothing else. Links open in your browser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kas raamatukogus on raamat olemas, näitab ESTER, raamatukogude e-kataloog. Loe küsib sealt ainult selle raamatu kohta. Lingid avanevad brauseris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write to us": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kirjuta meile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aasta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can keep using Loe while it downloads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Võid Loe kasutamist samal ajal jätkata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Young adult": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noortele"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your changes are safe on this phone and sync once it's online.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu muudatused on selles telefonis alles ja sünkroonitakse, kui telefon on taas võrgus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iCloud is full": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu iCloud on täis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves are empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riiulid on tühjad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves are only on this phone. Screen Time or a profile on this phone keeps apps out of iCloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid on ainult selles telefonis. Ekraaniaeg või selle telefoni profiil ei lase rakendustel iCloudi kasutada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves are only on this phone. To keep them safe and on your other devices, sign in to iCloud in the Settings app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid on ainult selles telefonis. Et need oleksid kaitstud ja ka su teistes seadmetes, logi rakenduses Seaded iCloudi sisse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves are safe on this phone. In the Settings app, check that you're signed in to your Apple Account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid on selles telefonis alles. Vaata rakenduses Seaded, kas oled oma Apple'i kontosse sisse logitud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves are safe on this phone. Loe tries again by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid on selles telefonis alles. Loe proovib ise uuesti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves sync with iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid sünkroonitakse iCloudiga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your shelves, ratings, pages, cover photos, tastes and libraries are kept on this phone and in your own iCloud. There's no Loe account and no Loe server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu riiulid, hinnangud, leheküljed, kaanefotod, maitsed ja raamatukogud hoitakse selles telefonis ja sinu enda iCloudis. Loel pole kontot ega serverit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tastes": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sinu maitse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud on välja lülitatud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud isn't allowed on this phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selles telefonis pole iCloud lubatud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud isn't available right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud pole praegu kättesaadav"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "p. %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "lk %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "p. %lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "et": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "lk %1$lld / %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
